DBY-W09 kernel build (MatePad 11 2021, HarmonyOS 4.3 / Linux 4.19.157)
Copyright (C) 2026 the contributors of this repository

This repository contains build scripts, patch files and documentation for a
Linux kernel that is based on Huawei's GPL-2.0 kernel source release for the
DBY-W09. The kernel source itself is *not* redistributed here; it is downloaded
from Huawei's open-source release page and patched by scripts/fetch_sources.sh.

